WEBVTT

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.750
Kanzato-kun...

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:06.360
oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:12.460
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:15.940
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.310
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:24.510
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:28.050
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:31.890
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:34.960
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.630
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.400
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:46.370
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:52.170
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:58.010
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:09.620
kasaneta inochi ga yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.330
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:19.170
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:26.700
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.590
You said one of them was still conscious?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:46.490
Yes, sir. We will question Morimoto
Kanaru during the transfer.

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:50.690
We will send a report after the other three testify.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.030
This is the only thing left.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.020
Morimoto?

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.160
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.290
I'm fine.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.390
How did we get here?

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.660
Where are Takuro and Kayano?

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:25.760
In a police helicopter.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:30.930
Megumi-san is safe, but Sakakiba-kun
has a minor burn on his back.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:34.800
Both of them are being interrogated separately.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.340
By Ito-san?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:42.380
No. Besides Inui-san, they were all new faces to me.

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:46.920
What about Jun?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.420
Before I knew it, he was gone.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.030
I'm sorry.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:56.930
If only I were able to save him while I was there...

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.090
It's not your fault.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.100
Aniki took him, I think.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:02.730
Your brother?

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.470
Anyway, how did you get there?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.140
I was taken with Jun-kun.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:14.810
Um...

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.540
I'll get a nurse.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:20.750
Morimoto.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:24.190
Thanks.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.760
For coming to help me.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.730
I thought I saw something really strange.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.630
Are you hurt at all?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.000
I'm okay.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.930
Thank you... too.

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.350
Was that?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.680
Inui-san said...

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:50.620
He wanted us to answer all
of their questions honestly.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:52.580
Sure.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.520
I'm sorry.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.510
So, is it done?

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.440
Hello? Shin, are you safe?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:03.680
I see.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.620
Aniki took Jun...

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:12.700
Kujo was alive, but I couldn't tell
if he was a Persona or human.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.440
All the Marebito were killed...

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.730
One of our classmates was there, too.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.970
There was also a girl identical
to Komatsubara Ayane.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:29.080
He was planning to transplant all the
collected Personas to an artificial body.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.450
I told the same to the policemen earlier.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.510
That's fine. Our conversation
is being tapped anyway.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.780
Kanzato appeared, as expected.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.330
As long it was he who took Jun, there's still hope.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.960
We'll take care of the rest
regarding Kujo's research.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.400
You guys did a great job...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.500
and I apologize.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.030
I know I won't be forgiven.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:58.200
I'm sorry, too... for hitting you.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.210
If only this twisted Persona research never began,

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.180
none of us would've had to go through this pain.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.890
Anything more would be...

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.520
No... no...

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:16.880
No!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.180
I...

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:21.920
I'm!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:10.000
The collected bionoids are artificial
human bodies utilizing stem cells.

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:14.320
Each body shows signs of past experimentation.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:19.980
Some bodies have post-surgery
human brains transplanted in them.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:26.920
One of the bodies has nearly
completed its growth...

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.830
What's the point of making them weak?

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:36.300
Also, records exist of an older body
getting equipped with multiple OS's

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:39.770
and sending it to Naginomori Academy.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.300
What for?

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:50.680
Spread a method measuring abilities as a game
among youths in order to find Persona latents.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.280
Is it still out there?

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:57.720
It's life span was set to end half a year ago.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:58.850
I see.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:08.540
Goodbye?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.960
Wait a sec. You mean?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:16.580
Isn't there anything we can do? We'll do anything.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:19.600
Megumi-san... I can feel it myself.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.480
Soon, I'll be...

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:24.350
I have no time left.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.690
Let's have you checked by
someone. Isn't there anyone?

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.450
You know...

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.720
Like... a doctor who created you?

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:33.450
...I don't know.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.150
Then let's go find them!

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.030
I'll definitely-!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.130
Megumi-san.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:42.330
I'm so glad I got to know you.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:45.770
Kanaru!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.210
Sakakiba-kun...

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:01.220
Thank you for always being so kind to me.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.060
I hope you and Megumi stay close.

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:14.260
Kanaru...

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.700
You're not a puppet.

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:25.410
You were ordered to do Shadow Extraction,
but you were able to stop yourself.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.650
That's because everyone was-

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:32.350
That Persona Kanzato-kun
cut off from you wasn't yours.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:37.620
That round one was your true Persona.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.820
It's probably a young Persona.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.260
You're a human now.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:51.200
Megumi-san...

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.580
Thank you... Megumi-san.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.140
Don't go, Kanaru.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:04.810
I'm sorry.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:15.960
You're okay not seeing Kanzato-kun?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.020
I'm sorry, Kanaru.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.590
For not being able to do anything.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.000
Kayano... What's up?

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:54.430
Nothing.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.970
This is Takuro's change of clothes.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.600
Thanks.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.470
Hey, Kanzato-kun...

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.750
About Kanaru...

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.580
You can tell him about it later.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.510
Takuro...

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:13.790
You were awake?

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:15.760
How's your back?

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:16.310
Shin...

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:19.690
Do you know where Morimoto would go?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:24.460
If you have an idea, go there.
If you don't, go find her!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.600
Hurry! Go!

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.170
Takuro!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.170
Kanzato-kun, don't ask us anything yet.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.170
Go look for Kanaru... and stay by her.

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:41.750
Please.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.980
Sign: "Today's Weather Forecast
- Cloudy & Afternoon Snowfall"

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:46.930
Kanzato-kun...

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:07.890
Morimoto?

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.470
I've been looking for you.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:16.990
Here.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:18.200
Thank you.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.840
Remember when we talked
about our future goals here?

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:26.870
Yes.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.970
I-I'm sorry about that time.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:36.710
You were having your own problems, but I
talked about something completely unrelated.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:42.730
It's fine.

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.360
I'm sorry, too.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.670
For not being able to come support
you at the Speech Contest.

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.370
It's no problem.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:04.840
Morimoto... is something bothering you?

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:09.660
You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:15.290
But if you ever feel like talking,
know I'll always be there to listen.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:23.230
If you wanna talk to a girl, there's always Kayano.

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:26.540
Sure...

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:32.170
Kanzato-kun... You said you don't
remember anything about ten years ago.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:33.200
...Right.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.640
I'm the same.

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:39.390
But... I found out why I don't.

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.950
I never had any memories from then to start with.

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.020
That picture book I borrowed from you...

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.860
I didn't understand...

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.960
why all the people in the village left.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:18:00.900
Everyone was supposed to be happy after
the boy returned with the glowing feathers.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:06.600
It wasn't the people who left.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:09.780
Maybe... the boy made them invisible to himself

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:13.040
by closing his heart from everyone.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.920
I don't know why he would do such a thing,

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:21.080
or what need there was to do so.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.260
Morimoto...

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:25.830
Kanzato-kun.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.890
In your eyes... How do I-

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.430
How do I look?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.170
How do you look?

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:40.100
Do I look like a normal girl to you?

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.280
Normal... more like...

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:49.420
I-I think... you're... really cute.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:03.170
My childhood memories were all made up, but...

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.340
The memories of the time spent with
Kanzato-kun, Megumi-san, Sakakiba-kun...

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.280
Jun-kun and Inui-san are all real.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.050
My own...

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.380
I don't wanna forget.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.230
It's snowing, Morimoto.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.430
It's so early.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:35.000
Yes...

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:43.870
Longer...

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.810
Kanzato-kun...

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.600
I wanted to...

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.230
Morimoto?

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:26.080
Hello?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.150
Oh, Morimoto is with me.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.490
...You're joking, right?

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.120
Morimoto?

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:57.810
Itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:03.880
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:10.160
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:15.430
kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:25.510
ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:30.880
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:37.080
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:42.990
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:46.960
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:53.170
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:58.940
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:06.040
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.250
One more day.

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:15.320
Just for a while.

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:17.960
Just for a moment.

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:20.530
Knowing that it's unforgivable.

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:25.600
I embrace those I love so dearly.

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.970
Together, we pierce through the tormented heart.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.810
Fall deeper, down into the darkness.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:35.710
A mask adorned with painful feathers.

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:38.940
The moment of retribution from that day.
